        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. During this two (2) year period, they will be permitted to bid on any posted bargaining unit position, except clerk/dispatcher. If their departmental seniority is the highest of any of the qualified bidders, they will be granted the position if, in the sole discretion of management, they have the knowledge, training, ability, skill and efficiency to immediately perform the work of the position and are physically qualified to perform all the duties of the position.",
